{"id":"drohung","lemma":"Drohung","pos":"noun","rank":4014,"glosses":["threat (expression of intent to injure or punish another)"],"ipa":"/ˈdʁoːʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f1/De-Drohung.ogg/De-Drohung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Drohung","plural":"Drohungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ist das eine Drohung?","en":"Is that a threat?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Deine Drohungen machen uns keine Angst.","en":"Your threats don't frighten us.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to make"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"fear"}]},{"text":"Das klingt fast wie eine Drohung.","en":"That almost sounds like a threat.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to ring","l":"klingen"},{"g":"almost"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom hat Drohungen erhalten.","en":"Tom has received threats.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"to receive"}]},{"text":"Es besteht kein Bedarf für Drohungen.","en":"There's no need for threats.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to succeed, to pass","l":"bestehen"},{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"need"},{"g":"for"},null]}]}